6, 2024","categories":["SASS"],"tags":["sass"],"thumbnail":null}}},{"node":{"id":"bd5b14be-a5a6-5fe2-879e-6195ef45fc30","fields":{"slug":"/posts/sass/sass/","gitLastModified":"Sep 28, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[SASS] CSS 전처리기 SASS SCSS","summary":"SASS는 CSS전처리기(Preprocessor)라고도 합니다. CSS 전(예비)처리기 입니다. 보통 언급되는 전치리기 3대장으로 Less, SASS(SCSS), Styleus가 있습니다. 그 중 SASS는 2006년부터 시작하여 가장 오래된 CSS 확장 언어이며, 그만큼 높은 성숙도와 많은 커뮤니티를 가지고 있고 기능도 훌륭합니다.","date":"May 16, 2024","categories":["SASS"],"tags":["sass"],"thumbnail":null}}}]},"file":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/a0287/profile-image.png","srcSet":"/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/6ecb6/profile-image.png 30w,\n/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/43a9d/profile-image.png 60w,\n/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/a0287/profile-image.png 120w,\n/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/f5f72/profile-image.png 240w","sizes":"(min-width: 120px) 120px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/2b147/profile-image.webp 30w,\n/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/caa3b/profile-image.webp 60w,\n/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/b15f9/profile-image.webp 120w,\n/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/b5014/profile-image.webp 240w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 120px) 120px, 100vw"}]},"width":120,"height":120}},"publicURL":"/static/95d5c91a398618bdf8d2f9056ca61afe/profile-image.png"},"ogImage":{"publicURL":"/static/44af5f25f3ad502366f13f32bdf92c04/og-image.png"}},"pageContext":{}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}